MiMo Dots

MiMo Dots is an independent derivative project developed from the open-source
Fei2411/DeepSeek-Bot project:
https://github.com/Fei2411/DeepSeek-Bot

The upstream project is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. This
project retains the Apache License and this attribution notice. MiMo Dots is a
separate application adapted for Xiaomi MiMo Desktop and is not an official
release of, or endorsed by, the upstream project or Xiaomi.
The upstream attribution notices are retained verbatim in UPSTREAM-NOTICE.

The standalone workbench and MiMo Desktop integration were developed for this
derivative. No Xiaomi MiMo, Grok Bot, or Cursor proprietary source code or
assets are included. The interface and anime-style avatar illustrations were
created for this project; the illustrations were generated for MiMo Dots and
do not depict named existing fictional characters.
